      "reason": "Read-only live probe (2026-10-14) showed action items at v2.actionItems.actions and audio at data.signed_url (t2 guessed other keys: every action item dropped, every audio download failed) and a 50-requests-per-~60s limit with X-Ratelimit headers; fixed with synthetic-fixture tests in commit on feat/pocket-to-mongodb",
